				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "`--with-seaside` is a temporary first-install option. It only matters when the deployment is created. If the deployment already exists, the flag has no effect. It exists while GemStone and GsDevKit are in flux. It will go away, and Seaside will become the default option."
			},
